#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Jimmy Chi|chapter=w:Bran Nue Dae|editors=w:Anita Heiss; Peter Minter|title=Anthology of Australian Aboriginal Literature|location=Montreal, Que.; Kingston, Ont.|publisher=[[w:McGill–Queen's University Press|McGill–Queen’s University Press]]|year=1990|year_published=2008|section=act II|page=137|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/anthologyofaustr0000unse/page/137/mode/1up|isbn=|passage=This '''fella''' song all about the Aboriginal people, coloured people, black people longa Australia. Us people want our land back, we want 'em rights, we want 'em fair deal, all same longa white man. Now this '''fella''' longa Canberra, he bin talkin' about a Bran Nue Dae—us people bin waiting for dijwun for 200 years now.}}
# {{lb|en|Internet slang}} An [[Internet]] [[troll]] [[engaged]] in [[information warfare]] against [[Russia]], especially in regards to the {{w|Russo-Ukrainian war}}.

